      "decimalPrecision": 1,
      "description": "Per job (grouped by its key in the workflow file, so matrix combinations count together): runners observed, matrix variants, the average and median across runners of each runner's average CPU busy and memory in use, and the highest memory any runner used. Covers the selected time range in every environment; uses ClickHouse SQL to compute medians.",
      "fillMode": "none",
